entries[118328] = { ["name"] = "Recipe Idea: Feast of Blood", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nUnique\nUse: Teaches you how to make a Feast of Blood.\nRecipe for 4 servings. Actual number of servings will vary based on cooking skill. You may get a new recipe idea while cooking.\nRequires Draenor Cooking (1)\n\nFeast of Blood\nUse: Feed up to 30 people in your raid or party with a Feast of Blood.\n\nIn so doing, you have a chance to obtain the recipe.\n\nRestores 8173 health and ( 2125 / 5 * 20) mana over 20 sec. If you spend at least 10 seconds eating you will become well fed and gain 550 in your attuned stat for 1 hour.\nSell Price:\nRequires Raw Elekk Meat (10), Raw Boar Meat (10), Raw Talbuk Meat (10), Raw Riverbeast Meat (10), Rylak Egg (10), Raw Clefthoof Meat (10)" }
